Blocked, and open rather than closed:
  T081  extraction fixtures. Three independent causes, none resolvable here.
        (a) Recording needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, which this work does not have.
        (b) gateway.compute.hashing.fixture_key digests request.model_dump_json()
            and trace_id is a declared field with no exclude=True, so FR-070's
            one-trace-id-per-run mints a different key every run — six distinct
            keys were observed for one document across six runs. A recorded
            fixture would miss on the next run regardless of (a).
        (c) DEFAULT_FIXTURE_ROOT resolves relative to the installed package, so
            from the model entry it lands in src/model/.venv/Lib/fixtures —
            not where plan.md places E006's fixtures.
        (b) and (c) are E004's and need no credential; they are being fixed on
        their own branch.
  T089  the regenerated ingestion report, blocked transitively on T081.

